## Assessment approve notification. See: EdsMessageManager.sendAssessmentApproveNotification
## $assessment - EdsAssessment
## $date - current date

<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
</head><body><p>Dear  $employeeAssessment.assessment.reviewer.getName(),</p>
<p>Please be advised that now you have approved the employee appraisal for $employeeAssessment.employee.getName() on $date, an email notification has been sent to your employee informing them about the appraisal. The employee can view your comments and rates on the appraisal.</p>
<p>The PDF version of the employee appraisal is attached for your attention.</p>
<p>Click <a href="$host/Hrms.html?link=$link" title="View assessment" target="_blank">here</a> to view the appraisal.</p>
<p>* If you are not able to click on the link, you can copy and paste the following address into your web browser:</p>
<p><a href="$host/Hrms.html?link=$link" title="View assessment" target="_blank">$host/Hrms.html?link=$link</a></p>
</body></html>